          <mxGeometry height="60" width="470" x="1861" y="2615" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FqrzKreNLr7S7h3mgNaQ-845" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#4D4D4D;strokeColor=#666666;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;在多步任务中，智能体可能需要先执行一些看似&quot;绕路&quot;的步骤，例如收集信息，才能最终完成任务&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
